Z||000001||Nashco||12-02-2001||03:48 AM||||My heater control panel is lit up.  If you take the radio panel overlay off (four screws at corners) and pop the face of the unit off (a screw on each side, if memory serves me right).  There will be a little tiny bulb in there; I had to replace mine, got it at Autozone.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
